    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your boyfriend wants to become a completely ordinary person instead of being true to himself \u2014 will this need to be tolerated by society prevail? A retro-styled queer story about self-discovery, acceptance of being transgender, and trust.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your boyfriend <strong>reacts when you pat him on the head</strong>\u00a0\u2014 truly an example of <i>interactive</i> fiction!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five possible endings</strong> \u2014 in a relationship, communication is key!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>~7000 words</strong> of a story about love, identities, and introspection. Help your partner deal with societal expectations and build a stable relationship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro style</strong> with <strong>modern conveniences!</strong> Connect a gamepad, enable a dyslexic-friendly font or choose the art style you prefer to have the best time possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>immersive sound design</strong> allows you to fully enjoy the experience of disagreeing with your partner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>free stylized manual</strong> is included!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can <strong>buy Bonjin ~ An Ordinary Man</strong>\u00a0at any moment \u2014 perhaps even right now?</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your boyfriend wants to become a completely ordinary person instead of being true to himself \u2014 will this need to be tolerated by society prevail? A retro-styled queer story about self-discovery, acceptance of being transgender, and trust.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your boyfriend <strong>reacts when you pat him on the head</strong>\u00a0\u2014 truly an example of <i>interactive</i> fiction!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five possible endings</strong> \u2014 in a relationship, communication is key!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>~7000 words</strong> of a story about love, identities, and introspection. Help your partner deal with societal expectations and build a stable relationship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro style</strong> with <strong>modern conveniences!</strong> Connect a gamepad, enable a dyslexic-friendly font or choose the art style you prefer to have the best time possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>immersive sound design</strong> allows you to fully enjoy the experience of disagreeing with your partner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>free stylized manual</strong> is included!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can <strong>buy Bonjin ~ An Ordinary Man</strong>\u00a0at any moment \u2014 perhaps even right now?</p></li></ul>",
